cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Please cite the archived release corresponding to the version you used.
  Zenodo release archives will be linked from the repository when available.
type: software
title: "Notandia for Zotero: publisher detection and verified reference highlighting"
authors:
  - family-names: Marcolongo
    given-names: Mario
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-2846-7115"
abstract: >-
  Notandia for Zotero identifies MDPI publications in Zotero libraries and detects verified MDPI references in reader documents using structured identifiers and metadata. Citation highlighting requires an exact reference label and a verified PDF location; ambiguous matches are skipped. Publisher detection is not an article-quality score. This plugin is maintained separately from the Notandia browser extension. Existing third-party credits and licence notices remain applicable.
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/notandia/zotero-plugin"
url: "https://github.com/notandia/zotero-plugin"
keywords:
  - Zotero
  - research integrity
  - reference management
  - citation navigation
